OL,5,G0100 Lyric Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe best of classical music
OL,7,     Fincluding full works, chamber
OL,8,     Fmusic and RTE lyric fm's acclaimed
OL,9,     FCD releases.
OL,10,G0700 Vox Nostra with Vlad Smishkewych
OL,11,     FFrom the human voice to the organ
OL,12,     Fand harpsichord, Vox Nostra
OL,13,     Fdiscovers just how expansive music
OL,14,     Fcan become`even when created
OL,15,     Fwithin four walls.
OL,16,G1000 The Hamilton Scores
OL,17,     FLet the Hamilton Scores become one
OL,18,     Fof your regular fixtures as George
OL,19,     FHamilton kicks off the weekend
OL,20,     Fwith an unbeatable line-up of
OL,21,     Fmusical greats and tales from his
OL,22,     Ftravels.
